{"id":"85e7af0f6e9d7688","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md","title":"Geometric Brownian Motion","display":"df-geometric-brownian — Geometric Brownian Motion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-geometric-brownian","aliases":["58-df-geometric-brownian","Geometric Brownian Motion"],"display":"df-geometric-brownian — Geometric Brownian Motion","depends_on":["[[58-df-brownian-motion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-geometric-brownian"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-geometric-brownian</span><span>Geometric Brownian Motion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-geometric-brownian — Geometric Brownian Motion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"58-df-brownian-motion\">58-df-brownian-motion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mu,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(S,W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mu,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"58-df-brownian-motion\">58-df-brownian-motion</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}brownian} \\vdash \\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S(S,W,\\mu,\\sigma,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land S\\in(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^{\\Omega})^{\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}}\\land\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(S(t)(\\omega)=s_0\\exp((\\mu-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2)t+\\sigma W(t)(\\omega))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}brownian} \\vdash \\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S(S,W,\\mu,\\sigma,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land S\\in(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^{\\Omega})^{\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}}\\land\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(S(t)(\\omega)=s_0\\exp((\\mu-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2)t+\\sigma W(t)(\\omega))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GBM: exponential of Brownian motion with drift；初值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\">\\(s_0\\)</span> 被要求为确定的正常数，因此不会把依赖未来信息的任意随机初值误收为适应过程。</li>\n<li>Log-normal distribution: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_t \\sim \\mathrm{LogN}\">\\(S_t \\sim \\mathrm{LogN}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Black-Scholes: asset price model</li>\n<li>Martingale: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_t / \\exp(\\mu t)\">\\(S_t / \\exp(\\mu t)\\)</span> when drift-adjusted</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Øksendal, Stochastic Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-brownian-motion","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-brownian-motion]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-brownian-motion","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-brownian-motion]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P,\\mu,\\sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}brownian} \\vdash \\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S(S,W,\\mu,\\sigma,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mu\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land S\\in(\\mathbb R_{>0}^{\\Omega})^{\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}}\\land\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(S(t)(\\omega)=s_0\\exp((\\mu-\\tfrac12\\sigma^2)t+\\sigma W(t)(\\omega))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"s_0","display":false},{"tex":"S_t \\sim \\mathrm{LogN}","display":false},{"tex":"S_t / \\exp(\\mu t)","display":false}],"bytes":1577,"backlinks":[{"id":"ba6dceed64879da7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^8$ (geometric-Brownian-motion predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-588","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md|58-df-geometric-brownian]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["948f8f3178040b74"]}